<h1>Alif to Yaa: Sound & Hamzat al-Wasl Lab</h1>
<p class="mut">Tap a letter to see where it is made, how it behaves, and how it contrasts with its neighbours. Then unlock the Hamzat al-Wasl (the "Helper Alif") rules and test yourself.</p>
